OL,3,ALes used a QR code to download a
OL,4,Aparking app - but it was a scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Les Howard could not find change
OL,7,Ffor parking during a trip to the coast,
OL,8,Fa quick response (QR) code on the meter
OL,9,Fseemed to be the answer.
OL,11,FBut the next day, the 61-year-old
OL,12,Frealised he had become the victim of an
OL,13,Fincreasingly common scam as criminals
OL,14,Fstarted taking money from his bank
OL,15,Faccount in #60 chunks.
OL,17,FReports of QR code-related scams have
OL,18,Fgone up by 700% in the past four years,
OL,19,Ffigures by Report Fraud have revealed.
